with the renamed indices visible in the hyperedge list:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->452230002,ExpressionUUID->"a660ccf4-3200-4849-b59a-9284ece5d290"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"TensorNetwork", "[", 
